Money Manager Ex 1.9.4 reference installation: licence and corresponding source

mmex_1.9.4-Ubuntu.24.04.noble_amd64.deb in this directory is the official Ubuntu 24.04 package of the upstream release v1.9.4 (GitHub release asset, 29,055,256 bytes, sha256 f410d50eeecb0a4b61578b048a2b3d501fcc69bac3eddd6a0a4b391f13332a34), redistributed as downloaded. solve.sh verifies its digest and unpacks it with dpkg-deb under /app/solution/mmex; only the development files of a statically linked library (usr/include, usr/lib) are left out. The executable and its resources are unchanged. SOURCE.json records the release digest and corresponding-source location.

This repository's own files (start.sh, solve.sh, seed.py, mmex_guard.c, uname) are not part of Money Manager Ex. seed.py writes the first-run answers into the product's private settings file. uname replaces the host's kernel text in the window title with a fixed text. mmex_guard.c is preloaded into the product: it keeps the Lua standard libraries closed, so that Lua can only calculate, and permits only exact installed WebKit helpers and fixed uname/lsb_release information options; other commands are refused.

