Corresponding source is the upstream tag v1.9.4 of https://github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex, commit 377d1f5bed96da377dce8f79a39939e86c300584, together with the submodules recorded at that commit. GitHub serves the tag as an archive at

  https://github.com/moneymanagerex/moneymanagerex/archive/refs/tags/v1.9.4.tar.gz

The commit is the stable identifier of the source.

The task is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Money Manager Ex developers; Money Manager Ex names the reference product only.

The installed reference installation also carries the Ubuntu shared libraries liblua5.3.so.0 (Lua, MIT license) and libpcre2-32.so.0 (PCRE2, BSD-3-Clause). Their package copyright notices are in LICENSES/Lua.txt and LICENSES/PCRE2.txt. Corresponding upstream source: https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.3.6.tar.gz and https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/releases/tag/pcre2-10.42; Ubuntu packaging sources are available from https://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/l/lua5.3/ and https://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/p/pcre2/.

